## Project-Specific AI Guidelines

### When Working with Feeds
- Always consider subscription validation patterns
- Include timestamp validation logic
- Verify Schnorr signature requirements
- Check access control modifiers

### When Working with Registries
- Follow factory pattern conventions
- Include interface validation
- Implement proper event emission
- Validate created contract addresses

### When Working with Cryptography
- Reference [LibSchnorr.sol](mdc:src/libs/LibSchnorr.sol) for signature patterns
- Include threshold validation
- Implement replay attack protection
- Test with edge cases

### When Adding New Features
1. Design interface first in [src/interfaces/](mdc:src/interfaces/)
2. Implement following existing patterns
3. Add comprehensive tests
4. Update relevant documentation
5. Security review before integration
